---
layout: base.njk
title: Game Rules
isHome: true
---
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="eyebrow">Reference sheets &middot; Built to print</div>
  <h1>{{ site.title }}</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">{{ site.tagline }} Each sheet is a complete summary of one game &mdash; scoring, fouls and terminology &mdash; typeset in two columns to print cleanly on US&nbsp;Letter, with a PDF ready to download.</p>
</header>

<ul class="game-list">
  {% for game in collections.games %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ game.url | url }}">
      <span class="game-title">{{ game.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="game-blurb">{{ game.data.blurb }}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<footer>{{ site.footnote }}</footer>
